{% doc %}
  A handler's business failure in the shape pos-module-mcp expects: the engine
  turns { ok: false, error: { message } } into a tool error the agent can read
  and act on, and records the outcome in its ledger.

  The message is read by the agent and may reach the person, so it says what
  happened in plain words and never carries record ids, query shapes or
  anything about why the desk refused beyond what the person may know.
  @param {string} message - What the agent should be told
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  assign error = { "message": message }
  assign out = { "ok": false, "error": error }
  return out
%}
